# Working with Microsoft Excel (Apache POI)

These examples demonstrate how to read and write Excel files using Apache POI.

## Topics Covered

- Reading data from Excel
- Writing data into Excel
- Writing data into a specific row and cell
- Writing dynamic data using user input

## Requirements

- Java
- Apache POI
- Maven

## Note

Update the Excel file path according to your project before running the examples.

Example:

```java
System.getProperty("user.dir") + "\\src\\test\\java\\practice\\test.xlsx"
```